{"id":"twitter:1737487966476370247","tweet_id":"1737487966476370247","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1737487966476370247","title":"@ninagol15 I need to double check my claim. Make sure it was a charge and not an allegation. Maybe that tweet is what I am remembering and not a charg","summary":"@ninagol15 I need to double check my claim. Make sure it was a charge and not an allegation. Maybe that tweet is what I am remembering and not a charge of rape Just a glorification of rape Will check. Is Cernovich an alleged rapist or someone who just celebrates rape.","date":"2023-12-20","published":"2023-12-20T14:59:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ninagol15/status/1737484511175164368","reply_tweet_id":"1737484511175164368","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ninagol15 I need to double check my claim. Make sure it was a charge and not an allegation.<br><br>Maybe that tweet is what I am remembering and not a charge of rape<br><br>Just a glorification of rape<br><br>Will check. Is Cernovich an alleged rapist or someone who just celebrates rape.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1737487966476370247","display_date":"December 20, 2023 · 14:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1737486347068141716","tweet_id":"1737486347068141716","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1737486347068141716","title":"@TheGrapeGatsby2 @horry_peter @NC_WASP @Schnibbywhips No. The difference between the Articles of Confederation and the Constitution is the difference ","summary":"@TheGrapeGatsby2 @horry_peter @NC_WASP @Schnibbywhips No. The difference between the Articles of Confederation and the Constitution is the difference between \"These United States\" and \"The United States\" The Nullification Crisis predates 1850. It set the precedent. The Union Army was the punctuation.","date":"2023-12-20","published":"2023-12-20T14:53:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheGrapeGatsby2/status/1737484901287444846","reply_tweet_id":"1737484901287444846","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TheGrapeGatsby2 @horry_peter @NC_WASP @Schnibbywhips No.<br><br>The difference between the Articles of Confederation and the Constitution is the difference between &quot;These United States&quot; and &quot;The United States&quot;<br><br>The Nullification Crisis predates 1850. It set the precedent.<br><br>The Union Army was the punctuation.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1737486347068141716","display_date":"December 20, 2023 · 14:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
