{"id":"twitter:1737483358563627427","tweet_id":"1737483358563627427","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1737483358563627427","title":"@TheGrapeGatsby2 @Wolf_Apparition @NC_WASP @Schnibbywhips The Declaration of Independence is not a Governing document. Secession is not a States right","summary":"@TheGrapeGatsby2 @Wolf_Apparition @NC_WASP @Schnibbywhips The Declaration of Independence is not a Governing document. Secession is not a States right. See Nullification crisis of 1830 Not a single court has allowed secession. Nor has the US Government. They opened a can of whoop ass on the South for trying","date":"2023-12-20","published":"2023-12-20T14:41:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheGrapeGatsby2/status/1737481829265875109","reply_tweet_id":"1737481829265875109","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TheGrapeGatsby2 @Wolf_Apparition @NC_WASP @Schnibbywhips The Declaration of Independence is not a Governing document.<br><br>Secession is not a States right.<br><br>See Nullification crisis of 1830<br><br>Not a single court has allowed secession.<br><br>Nor has the US Government. They opened a can of whoop ass on the South for trying</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1737483358563627427","display_date":"December 20, 2023 · 14:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
