{"id":"twitter:1735820420203331591","tweet_id":"1735820420203331591","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735820420203331591","title":"@GuitarAnon17 @jimstewartson You don't have to prove things are true to win a defamation case, silly. The plaintiff has to prove you knew them to be l","summary":"@GuitarAnon17 @jimstewartson You don't have to prove things are true to win a defamation case, silly. The plaintiff has to prove you knew them to be lie.. And even if you knew them to be lies rhe plaintiff has to prove you willfully spread the lies with malice intent. Sullivan is a high bar.","date":"2023-12-16","published":"2023-12-16T00:33:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/GuitarAnon17/status/1735812209979109801","reply_tweet_id":"1735812209979109801","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GuitarAnon17 @jimstewartson You don&#x27;t have to prove things are true to win a defamation case, silly.<br><br>The plaintiff has to prove you knew them to be lie..<br><br>And even if you knew them to be lies rhe plaintiff has to prove you willfully spread the lies with malice intent.<br><br>Sullivan is a high bar.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735820420203331591","display_date":"December 16, 2023 · 00:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
