{"id":"twitter:1735304117512294832","tweet_id":"1735304117512294832","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735304117512294832","title":"Goal was to hopefully shave few points from Jimmy Carter here & there Electoral vote Reagan/Bush: 489 (90.9%) Carter/Mondale: 49 (9.1%) Reagan/Bush: 4","summary":"Goal was to hopefully shave few points from Jimmy Carter here & there Electoral vote Reagan/Bush: 489 (90.9%) Carter/Mondale: 49 (9.1%) Reagan/Bush: 43,903,230 (50.7%) Carter/Mondale: 35,480,115 (41.0%) Anderson/Lucey: 5,719,850 (6.6%) Clark/Koch: 921,128 (1.1%) didnt matter","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T14:21:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735303609183539278","reply_tweet_id":"1735303609183539278","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Goal was to hopefully shave few points from Jimmy Carter here &amp; there<br><br>Electoral vote<br><br>Reagan/Bush: 489 (90.9%)<br>Carter/Mondale: 49 (9.1%)<br><br>Reagan/Bush: 43,903,230 (50.7%)<br>Carter/Mondale: 35,480,115 (41.0%)<br>Anderson/Lucey: 5,719,850 (6.6%)<br>Clark/Koch: 921,128 (1.1%)<br><br>didnt matter</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735304117512294832","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 14:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1735303609183539278","tweet_id":"1735303609183539278","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735303609183539278","title":"In 1980 Koch ran as VP for the Libertarian Party for Ed Clark's ticket. This got around campaign finance laws as now Koch's could spend unlimited fund","summary":"In 1980 Koch ran as VP for the Libertarian Party for Ed Clark's ticket. This got around campaign finance laws as now Koch's could spend unlimited funds on their own campaign. David Koch ran as a libertarian pro-marijuana candidate. Prototypes of libertarian brogrammers","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T14:19:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735303145775829462","reply_tweet_id":"1735303145775829462","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In 1980 Koch ran as VP for the Libertarian Party for Ed Clark&#x27;s ticket.<br><br>This got around campaign finance laws as now Koch&#x27;s could spend unlimited funds on their own campaign.<br><br>David Koch ran as a libertarian pro-marijuana candidate. Prototypes of libertarian brogrammers</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735303609183539278","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 14:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1735303145775829462","tweet_id":"1735303145775829462","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735303145775829462","title":"Many members of the Libertarian Party are looking into a Class Action Lawsuit against the Mises Caucus PAC. But really same people who did the MAGA ta","summary":"Many members of the Libertarian Party are looking into a Class Action Lawsuit against the Mises Caucus PAC. But really same people who did the MAGA take over of the Libertarian Party have been using the LP to play at the margins for much longer. Began in 1980 with David Koch https://t.co/As09BJh1P1","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T14:18:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Many members of the Libertarian Party are looking into a Class Action Lawsuit against the Mises Caucus PAC.<br><br>But really same people who did the MAGA take over of the Libertarian Party have been using the LP to play at the margins for much longer.<br><br>Began in 1980 with David Koch <a href=\"https://t.co/As09BJh1P1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/As09BJh1P1</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7e910488cda54e74033603bd03799293.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735303145775829462","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 14:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7e910488cda54e74033603bd03799293.jpg"]}
