{"id":"twitter:1735290840132550686","tweet_id":"1735290840132550686","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735290840132550686","title":"@ArtemisLynn The Iran Hostage crisis. Majority were held for 444 days November 4, 1979, Terry Anderson was held the longest 1985-1991 I don't care wha","summary":"@ArtemisLynn The Iran Hostage crisis. Majority were held for 444 days November 4, 1979, Terry Anderson was held the longest 1985-1991 I don't care what you call it. it isn't a cease fire when hostages are still held. It can not happen again Not another 444 days","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T13:29:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ArtemisLynn/status/1735288641386418236","reply_tweet_id":"1735288641386418236","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ArtemisLynn The Iran Hostage crisis.<br><br>Majority were held for 444 days<br><br>November 4, 1979,<br><br>Terry Anderson was held the longest 1985-1991<br><br>I don&#x27;t care what you call it. it isn&#x27;t a cease fire when hostages are still held.<br><br>It can not happen again<br><br>Not another 444 days</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735290840132550686","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 13:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
