{"id":"twitter:1735288345683542025","tweet_id":"1735288345683542025","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735288345683542025","title":"@ArtemisLynn Nor would I. As long as one hostage is held there is no peace. We cant have 1980-1991 again but that was not what the ambassador said. An","summary":"@ArtemisLynn Nor would I. As long as one hostage is held there is no peace. We cant have 1980-1991 again but that was not what the ambassador said. And that was after Biden's remarks on conduct of war. I don't think that is accidental.","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T13:19:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ArtemisLynn/status/1735284621041176633","reply_tweet_id":"1735284621041176633","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ArtemisLynn Nor would I.<br><br> As long as one hostage is held there is no peace. We cant have 1980-1991 again<br><br>but that was not what the ambassador said.<br><br>And that was after Biden&#x27;s remarks on conduct of war.<br><br>I don&#x27;t think that is accidental.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735288345683542025","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 13:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
