{"id":"twitter:1735278427517616442","tweet_id":"1735278427517616442","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735278427517616442","title":"@Rail_splitter1 At least they are saying the truth out loud now. Netanhayu and the Likud Party do not want a two state solution to peace. They need th","summary":"@Rail_splitter1 At least they are saying the truth out loud now. Netanhayu and the Likud Party do not want a two state solution to peace. They need the war to stay in power. Makes you wonder about the eight hour delay. Palestinian sovereignty is only path to long standing peace for Israel.","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T12:39:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Rail_splitter1/status/1735275589190443139","reply_tweet_id":"1735275589190443139","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Rail_splitter1 At least they are saying the truth out loud now.<br><br>Netanhayu and the Likud Party do not want a two state solution to peace.<br><br>They need the war to stay in power. Makes you wonder about the eight hour delay. <br><br>Palestinian sovereignty is only path to long standing peace for Israel.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735278427517616442","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 12:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
