{"id":"twitter:1735134340198134197","tweet_id":"1735134340198134197","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735134340198134197","title":"@PolyglotFella I mean I am not a pollster but it seems based on outcomes, not guesses, these polls severely underestimate likely female voter, and fir","summary":"@PolyglotFella I mean I am not a pollster but it seems based on outcomes, not guesses, these polls severely underestimate likely female voter, and first time female voters. In term of Presidential race really only a group of states matter. So no matter what a National Poll is vanity number.","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T03:07:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PolyglotFella/status/1735133140035760298","reply_tweet_id":"1735133140035760298","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PolyglotFella I mean I am not a pollster but it seems based on outcomes, not guesses, these polls severely underestimate likely female voter, and first time female voters.<br><br>In term of Presidential race really only a group of states matter. So no matter what a National Poll is vanity number.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735134340198134197","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 03:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1735133006430392808","tweet_id":"1735133006430392808","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735133006430392808","title":"@PolyglotFella Bad modeling of likely voter turnout. Start with the wrong denominator and your vote is borked. The floor for either party is 35-40% pr","summary":"@PolyglotFella Bad modeling of likely voter turnout. Start with the wrong denominator and your vote is borked. The floor for either party is 35-40% probably higher. Single issue voters, party identity, etc. So it's always a 10-15% fight. And they have sampling wrong.","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T03:02:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PolyglotFella/status/1735085019633205273","reply_tweet_id":"1735085019633205273","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PolyglotFella Bad modeling of likely voter turnout.<br><br>Start with the wrong denominator and your vote is borked.<br><br>The floor for either party is 35-40% probably higher. Single issue voters, party identity, etc.<br><br>So it&#x27;s always a 10-15% fight.<br><br>And they have sampling wrong.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735133006430392808","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 03:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
