{"id":"twitter:1735114497516322976","tweet_id":"1735114497516322976","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735114497516322976","title":"In fact impeaching Clinton started way back in 1994. September 1994, mails \"The Clinton Chronicles\" video to all 500 or so of its members with a cover","summary":"In fact impeaching Clinton started way back in 1994. September 1994, mails \"The Clinton Chronicles\" video to all 500 or so of its members with a cover letter urging them to \"pass it on to a friend, relative, business associate, public official or member of the media\" 1994","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T01:48:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735114145538757020","reply_tweet_id":"1735114145538757020","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In fact impeaching Clinton started way back in 1994.<br><br>September 1994, mails &quot;The Clinton Chronicles&quot;  video to all 500 or so of its members with a cover letter urging them  to &quot;pass it on to a friend, relative, business associate, public  official or member of the media&quot;<br><br>1994</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735114497516322976","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 01:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1735114145538757020","tweet_id":"1735114145538757020","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1735114145538757020","title":"This is not new. It is the old playbook The Council for National Policy (CNP) met in June, 1997. On January 17, 1998 CNP under the auspices of \"Citize","summary":"This is not new. It is the old playbook The Council for National Policy (CNP) met in June, 1997. On January 17, 1998 CNP under the auspices of \"Citizens For Honest Government\" published \"\"impeachment organizers kit.\" This was seven months BEFORE Clinton lied about Monica. https://x.com/AdamKinzinger/status/1735089577423954270","date":"2023-12-14","published":"2023-12-14T01:47:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>This is not new. It is the old  playbook<br><br>The Council for National  Policy (CNP) met  in June, 1997.<br><br>On  January 17, 1998 CNP under the auspices of &quot;Citizens For Honest Government&quot;  published &quot;&quot;impeachment organizers kit.&quot;<br><br>This was seven months BEFORE Clinton lied about Monica. <a href=\"https://x.com/AdamKinzinger/status/1735089577423954270\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/AdamKinzinger/status/1735089577423954270</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1735114145538757020","display_date":"December 14, 2023 · 01:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
