{"id":"twitter:1734391538354925627","tweet_id":"1734391538354925627","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1734391538354925627","title":"@dromanocpm @reghorizon @PiottiAyisha @ellliottt @GaryMarcus I think people have been harvesting online political data through polling and surveys lon","summary":"@dromanocpm @reghorizon @PiottiAyisha @ellliottt @GaryMarcus I think people have been harvesting online political data through polling and surveys long before Cambridge Analytic too One thing I find as a navigate disinfo/misinfo/political blogs from 2001-2013...a lot of polling...like a lot This website was from Center of Media Research https://t.co/VonGu3XT","date":"2023-12-12","published":"2023-12-12T01:55:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dromanocpm/status/1721925619598918119","reply_tweet_id":"1721925619598918119","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dromanocpm @reghorizon @PiottiAyisha @ellliottt @GaryMarcus I think people have been harvesting online political data through polling and surveys long before Cambridge Analytic too<br><br>One thing I find as a navigate disinfo/misinfo/political blogs from 2001-2013...a lot of polling...like a lot<br><br>This website was from  Center of Media Research <a href=\"https://t.co/VonGu3XTKy\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/VonGu3XTKy</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/fc684de3c64054d17a6da2ca0989823b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1734391538354925627","display_date":"December 12, 2023 · 01:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/fc684de3c64054d17a6da2ca0989823b.jpg"]}
