{"id":"twitter:2083239407465775402","tweet_id":"2083239407465775402","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2083239407465775402","title":"@JohnHolder64994 I have surfed in San Diego years ago, but wow the Pacific is cold. Where I first really learned to pop up. I couldn't imagine LA. I d","summary":"@JohnHolder64994 I have surfed in San Diego years ago, but wow the Pacific is cold. Where I first really learned to pop up. I couldn't imagine LA. I don't have a dry or wet suit. More an amateur. I live in New England. Most folk surf in the Winter during Nor'easters.... Boggles my mind","date":"2026-07-31","published":"2026-07-31T17:12:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JohnHolder64994/status/2083235860468711797","reply_tweet_id":"2083235860468711797","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JohnHolder64994 I have surfed in San Diego years ago, but wow the Pacific is cold.<br><br>Where I first really learned to pop up. <br><br>I couldn&#x27;t imagine LA. I don&#x27;t have a dry or wet suit.<br><br>More an amateur.<br><br>I live in New England. Most folk surf in the Winter during Nor&#x27;easters.... Boggles my mind</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2083239407465775402","display_date":"July 31, 2026 · 17:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
