{"id":"twitter:1732215275057979729","tweet_id":"1732215275057979729","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1732215275057979729","title":"@uname_was_taken 100% I encourage companies I work with to write in their AUP/social media as a no go zone for employees in scope of sensitive stuff. ","summary":"@uname_was_taken 100% I encourage companies I work with to write in their AUP/social media as a no go zone for employees in scope of sensitive stuff. There are a lot of amateur slueths out there that need to be reminded it's the fking VK and you don't want to be a part of it.","date":"2023-12-06","published":"2023-12-06T01:47:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/uname_was_taken/status/1732212446129983565","reply_tweet_id":"1732212446129983565","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@uname_was_taken 100%<br><br>I encourage companies I work with to write in their AUP/social media as a no go zone for employees in scope of sensitive stuff.<br><br>There are a lot of amateur slueths out there that need to be reminded <br><br>it&#x27;s the fking VK and you don&#x27;t want to be a part of it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1732215275057979729","display_date":"December 06, 2023 · 01:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1732214327455744014","tweet_id":"1732214327455744014","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1732214327455744014","title":"@dromanocpm Granted our model was biased a priori with an existing tool set focused on adtech analysis, but sometimes math just works out. Below is sm","summary":"@dromanocpm Granted our model was biased a priori with an existing tool set focused on adtech analysis, but sometimes math just works out. Below is small snippet of correlations of different accounts and different time points in advertising activity the model looked for in data and accounts https://t.co/VKkbyvbfM3","date":"2023-12-06","published":"2023-12-06T01:44:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1732212691760976036","reply_tweet_id":"1732212691760976036","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dromanocpm Granted our model was biased a priori with an existing tool set focused on adtech analysis, but sometimes math just works out.<br><br>Below is small snippet of correlations of different accounts and different time points in advertising activity the model looked for in data and accounts <a href=\"https://t.co/VKkbyvbfM3\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/VKkbyvbfM3</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8867e6eeab691401cee68c7d269b3524.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1732214327455744014","display_date":"December 06, 2023 · 01:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8867e6eeab691401cee68c7d269b3524.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1732212691760976036","tweet_id":"1732212691760976036","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1732212691760976036","title":"Working with @dromanocpm we trained a variety of models using close to 27,000 tweets with \"ukronazi\" looking to see how stories traveled Ad-buys withi","summary":"Working with @dromanocpm we trained a variety of models using close to 27,000 tweets with \"ukronazi\" looking to see how stories traveled Ad-buys within 1 degree were always our best predictor of sus AF influence campaigns and when they flared... ads often not content related https://t.co/lF4NrbqliQ","date":"2023-12-06","published":"2023-12-06T01:37:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1732207012929208362","reply_tweet_id":"1732207012929208362","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Working with @dromanocpm we trained a variety of models using close to 27,000 tweets with &quot;ukronazi&quot; looking to see how stories traveled <br><br>Ad-buys within 1 degree were always our best predictor of sus AF influence campaigns and when they flared... ads often not content related <a href=\"https://t.co/lF4NrbqliQ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/lF4NrbqliQ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4df74eb3d4cd0678230490802ddfebac.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1732212691760976036","display_date":"December 06, 2023 · 01:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4df74eb3d4cd0678230490802ddfebac.png"]}
