{"id":"twitter:1732208422450254311","tweet_id":"1732208422450254311","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1732208422450254311","title":"General rules when thinking DM Spam Do your friends just send you a random link with no context? If they do, get new friends. A random link, from a tr","summary":"General rules when thinking DM Spam Do your friends just send you a random link with no context? If they do, get new friends. A random link, from a trusted friend is always suspect, especially so missing any context or convo. Next step look at url. VK is Russian social mediq https://t.co/B7jMfGiAui","date":"2023-12-06","published":"2023-12-06T01:20:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>General rules when thinking DM Spam<br><br>Do your friends just send you a random link with no context?<br><br>If they do, get new friends.<br><br>A random link, from a trusted friend is always suspect, especially so missing any context or convo.<br><br>Next step look at url.<br><br>VK is Russian social mediq <a href=\"https://t.co/B7jMfGiAui\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/B7jMfGiAui</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1210db725cfa3d14e81479db6847ad92.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1732208422450254311","display_date":"December 06, 2023 · 01:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1210db725cfa3d14e81479db6847ad92.jpg"]}
