{"id":"twitter:1731776540038267341","tweet_id":"1731776540038267341","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1731776540038267341","title":"@OHAI_INVR I just finished Hoffman's \"Oligarchs.\" I wanted to back and see who was hired when this was covered. Of course it was Caputo. Just saved me","summary":"@OHAI_INVR I just finished Hoffman's \"Oligarchs.\" I wanted to back and see who was hired when this was covered. Of course it was Caputo. Just saved me some research. MTV was asked first, but they said no, \"It looks too corrupt.\" https://t.co/Vn8GmvaaCo","date":"2023-12-04","published":"2023-12-04T20:44:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1731775253066494033","reply_tweet_id":"1731775253066494033","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@OHAI_INVR I just finished Hoffman&#x27;s &quot;Oligarchs.&quot;<br><br>I wanted to back and see who was hired when this was covered.<br><br>Of course it was Caputo. Just saved me some research.<br><br>MTV was asked first, but they said no, &quot;It looks too corrupt.&quot; <a href=\"https://t.co/Vn8GmvaaCo\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Vn8GmvaaCo</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ae480afe7d35d4641cfdf80a8a7df983.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1731776540038267341","display_date":"December 04, 2023 · 20:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ae480afe7d35d4641cfdf80a8a7df983.jpg"]}
