{"id":"twitter:1731362735739310226","tweet_id":"1731362735739310226","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1731362735739310226","title":"Which always brings back to the Trolling Guide commissioned by Lind and Weyrich commissioned written by Eric Heubeck Back in 2001 http://web.archive.o","summary":"Which always brings back to the Trolling Guide commissioned by Lind and Weyrich commissioned written by Eric Heubeck Back in 2001 http://web.archive.org/web/20010713152425/www.freecongress.org/centers/conservatism/traditionalist.htm It just reads so Russian. or at least someone who studied literary analysis based on Russian and Easter European methods https:","date":"2023-12-03","published":"2023-12-03T17:20:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1731361633870418048","reply_tweet_id":"1731361633870418048","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Which always brings back to the Trolling Guide commissioned by  Lind and Weyrich commissioned  written by Eric Heubeck<br><br>Back in 2001<br><br><a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20010713152425/www.freecongress.org/centers/conservatism/traditionalist.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">http://web.archive.org/web/20010713152425/www.freecongress.org/centers/conservatism/traditionalist.htm</a><br><br>It just reads so Russian. or at least someone who studied literary analysis based on Russian and Easter European methods <a href=\"https://t.co/uHpJWog804\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/uHpJWog804</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d336eb801ee8dc098864f8c7d4b9de9d.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/671033c16c72be250c8fc61b516eac3d.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9703c336fcb70c372051a58af79a01f5.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twi