{"id":"twitter:1729263057350840655","tweet_id":"1729263057350840655","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1729263057350840655","title":"@weijander It's very American We have a Farmer's Almanac that names many different moons, These though are usually traced back to Algonquin Language G","summary":"@weijander It's very American We have a Farmer's Almanac that names many different moons, These though are usually traced back to Algonquin Language Group Nations that were in the Northeast before Europeans Today's full moon is the Beaver Moon 1/2","date":"2023-11-27","published":"2023-11-27T22:16:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1729262423289569302","reply_tweet_id":"1729262423289569302","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@weijander It&#x27;s very American<br><br>We have a Farmer&#x27;s Almanac that names many different moons,<br><br>These though are usually traced back to Algonquin Language Group Nations that were in the Northeast before Europeans<br><br>Today&#x27;s full moon is the Beaver Moon<br><br>1/2</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1729263057350840655","display_date":"November 27, 2023 · 22:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
