{"id":"twitter:1729192423866388529","tweet_id":"1729192423866388529","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1729192423866388529","title":"Here is the thing with Active Measures...they are rarely new If there was a trucker convoy protest in DC in 2013 If there was a trucker convoy protest","summary":"Here is the thing with Active Measures...they are rarely new If there was a trucker convoy protest in DC in 2013 If there was a trucker convoy protest in Canada 2021-2022 If there is a trucker convoy protest in Poland in 2023 You can kinda sus out the same players involved https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1729165405577761152 https://t.co/WZwk3nohY1","date":"2023-11-27","published":"2023-11-27T17:36:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Here is the thing with Active Measures...they are rarely new<br><br>If there was a trucker convoy protest in DC in 2013<br>If there was a trucker convoy protest in Canada 2021-2022<br>If there is a trucker convoy protest in Poland in 2023<br><br>You can kinda sus out the same players involved <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1729165405577761152\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1729165405577761152</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/WZwk3nohY1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/WZwk3nohY1</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/621d94fcf8125fa11d5b0b12cc98815c.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3c201ca0338c84297e441f7ac27e846b.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1729192423866388529","display_date":"November 27, 2023 · 17:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/621d94fcf8125fa11d5b0b12cc98815c.png","/archive/twitter/media/3c201ca0338c84297e441f7ac27e846b.png"]}
