{"id":"twitter:1728900046924726368","tweet_id":"1728900046924726368","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1728900046924726368","title":"Is this where \"rent free in your mind\" comes from: refer to rent seeking, a subprogram initiated in a seminal paper by Tullock in 1967, and christened","summary":"Is this where \"rent free in your mind\" comes from: refer to rent seeking, a subprogram initiated in a seminal paper by Tullock in 1967, and christened with thistitle by Anne Krueger in 1974. At base, the central idea emerges from the natural mind-set of the economist\" https://t.co/AV4Ad9zIfY","date":"2023-11-26","published":"2023-11-26T22:14:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Is this where &quot;rent free in your mind&quot; comes from:<br><br> refer to rent seeking, a subprogram initiated in a seminal paper by Tullock in 1967, and christened with thistitle by Anne Krueger in 1974. At base, the central idea emerges from the natural mind-set of the economist&quot; <a href=\"https://t.co/AV4Ad9zIfY\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/AV4Ad9zIfY</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3fe5ce37b91ab9ff879135c4c829cefe.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1728900046924726368","display_date":"November 26, 2023 · 22:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/3fe5ce37b91ab9ff879135c4c829cefe.jpg"]}
