{"id":"twitter:1728892542585012422","tweet_id":"1728892542585012422","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1728892542585012422","title":"But let's look at Hoppe's own words The title, I am guessing, is a play on Neitzche I don't pretend to be an economist or have read the Libertarian on","summary":"But let's look at Hoppe's own words The title, I am guessing, is a play on Neitzche I don't pretend to be an economist or have read the Libertarian ones. You can ask a libertarian, at your own risk. They can give Russians a run for the money in the contest of too many words https://t.co/57GytgMotX","date":"2023-11-26","published":"2023-11-26T21:44:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1728877691213082683","reply_tweet_id":"1728877691213082683","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>But let&#x27;s look at Hoppe&#x27;s own words<br><br>The title, I am guessing, is a play on Neitzche<br><br>I don&#x27;t pretend to be an economist or have read the Libertarian ones.<br><br>You can ask a libertarian, at your own risk.<br><br>They can give Russians a run for the money in the contest of too many words <a href=\"https://t.co/57GytgMotX\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/57GytgMotX</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/efbfc206e77e350086fd800f0da75c7b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1728892542585012422","display_date":"November 26, 2023 · 21:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/efbfc206e77e350086fd800f0da75c7b.jpg"]}
