{"id":"twitter:1727025488571588956","tweet_id":"1727025488571588956","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1727025488571588956","title":"@PreppyProf @Amtrak My question of social capital and social brokering isn;t a rejection of Capitalism either, after birth control, free markets have ","summary":"@PreppyProf @Amtrak My question of social capital and social brokering isn;t a rejection of Capitalism either, after birth control, free markets have the greatest liberating force in history. think what if our epochs were defined in weaving and not weaponry? Knowledge as building not brokering","date":"2023-11-21","published":"2023-11-21T18:05:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1727024990065991865","reply_tweet_id":"1727024990065991865","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PreppyProf @Amtrak My question of social capital and social brokering isn;t a rejection of Capitalism either,<br><br>after birth control, free markets have the  greatest liberating force in history.<br><br>think what if our epochs were defined in weaving and not weaponry?<br><br>Knowledge as building not brokering</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1727025488571588956","display_date":"November 21, 2023 · 18:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1727024990065991865","tweet_id":"1727024990065991865","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1727024990065991865","title":"@PreppyProf @Amtrak I am reading a ton of early right wing evangelicals, it reads like literary analysis Rosenblat and afferent and aesthetics Half of","summary":"@PreppyProf @Amtrak I am reading a ton of early right wing evangelicals, it reads like literary analysis Rosenblat and afferent and aesthetics Half of anthropological methods come out of Soviet psychology and literary analysis I trend Bakhtinian and Kristeva, apply rhizomes to track influence","date":"2023-11-21","published":"2023-11-21T18:03:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1727024232067109248","reply_tweet_id":"1727024232067109248","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PreppyProf @Amtrak I am reading a ton of early right wing evangelicals, it reads like literary analysis<br><br>Rosenblat and afferent and aesthetics<br><br>Half of anthropological methods come out of Soviet psychology and literary analysis<br><br>I trend Bakhtinian and Kristeva, apply rhizomes to track influence</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1727024990065991865","display_date":"November 21, 2023 · 18:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1727024232067109248","tweet_id":"1727024232067109248","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1727024232067109248","title":"@PreppyProf @Amtrak I enjoy comparing Vygotsky being translated for first time in English docs and in US Gov 78-81 docs Reciprocal Teaching vs Choitlu","summary":"@PreppyProf @Amtrak I enjoy comparing Vygotsky being translated for first time in English docs and in US Gov 78-81 docs Reciprocal Teaching vs Choitlu's study of reflexive control is super fun Can see difference influences and bias and I came off wrong, I like Rosseau, just Colonel Sanders more","date":"2023-11-21","published":"2023-11-21T18:00:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PreppyProf/status/1727023145276817890","reply_tweet_id":"1727023145276817890","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PreppyProf @Amtrak I enjoy comparing Vygotsky being translated for  first time in English docs and in US Gov 78-81 docs<br><br>Reciprocal Teaching vs Choitlu&#x27;s study of reflexive control is super fun<br><br>Can see difference influences and bias<br><br>and I came off wrong, I like Rosseau, just Colonel Sanders more</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1727024232067109248","display_date":"November 21, 2023 · 18:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
