{"id":"twitter:1725895272021041309","tweet_id":"1725895272021041309","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1725895272021041309","title":"@sigaretter @KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks Currently digging into the Dialogue of Civilization branch of nonsense, but just squirrelling away names and","summary":"@sigaretter @KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks Currently digging into the Dialogue of Civilization branch of nonsense, but just squirrelling away names and artifacts for now. Try to follow the citations through the noise. https://t.co/nHG3ZDWkOF","date":"2023-11-18","published":"2023-11-18T15:14:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1725894068553556007","reply_tweet_id":"1725894068553556007","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@sigaretter @KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks Currently digging into the Dialogue of Civilization branch of nonsense, but just squirrelling away names and artifacts for now.<br><br>Try to follow the citations through the noise. <a href=\"https://t.co/nHG3ZDWkOF\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/nHG3ZDWkOF</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/c53cb915fd7f839e07c3b9120388279a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1725895272021041309","display_date":"November 18, 2023 · 15:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/c53cb915fd7f839e07c3b9120388279a.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1725894068553556007","tweet_id":"1725894068553556007","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1725894068553556007","title":"@sigaretter @KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks I have been trying to collect and find different conference agendas before they get erased. We get the relig","summary":"@sigaretter @KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks I have been trying to collect and find different conference agendas before they get erased. We get the religious bent through World Congress of Families in US . Europe gets the Dialogue of Civilization type programs and quasi-academic tenured tankies.","date":"2023-11-18","published":"2023-11-18T15:09:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/sigaretter/status/1725891128392622172","reply_tweet_id":"1725891128392622172","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@sigaretter @KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks I have been trying to collect and find different conference agendas before they get erased. <br><br>We get the religious bent through World Congress of Families in US .<br><br> Europe gets the Dialogue of Civilization type programs and quasi-academic tenured tankies.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1725894068553556007","display_date":"November 18, 2023 · 15:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1725892485539393620","tweet_id":"1725892485539393620","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1725892485539393620","title":"@KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks Good point. And plenty of politicians and businesses folk had deals they had to give up. I know in US we have \"charged\" ","summary":"@KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks Good point. And plenty of politicians and businesses folk had deals they had to give up. I know in US we have \"charged\" academic institutions, but I don't know if we have sanctioned one. I will say a poor editorial decision in 2023 (haven't read book, will to map citations)","date":"2023-11-18","published":"2023-11-18T15:03:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/KeirGiles/status/1725890484936032758","reply_tweet_id":"1725890484936032758","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@KeirGiles @NKuhrt @YaleBooks Good point. And plenty of politicians and businesses folk had deals they had to give up.<br><br>I know in US we have &quot;charged&quot; academic institutions, but I don&#x27;t know if we have sanctioned one. <br><br>I will say a poor editorial decision in 2023 (haven&#x27;t read book, will to map citations)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1725892485539393620","display_date":"November 18, 2023 · 15:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
