{"id":"twitter:1721904497772089761","tweet_id":"1721904497772089761","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1721904497772089761","title":"@noninjaskillz He could still get 49ish% The floor in American politics is probably 35-40 on party identity alone and, just a hypothesis, much higher ","summary":"@noninjaskillz He could still get 49ish% The floor in American politics is probably 35-40 on party identity alone and, just a hypothesis, much higher on GOP side given traditions of purity tests and single issue voters. I just like making predictions on past data, not future speculation","date":"2023-11-07","published":"2023-11-07T14:56:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/noninjaskillz/status/1721903301887943106","reply_tweet_id":"1721903301887943106","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@noninjaskillz He could still get 49ish%<br><br>The floor in American politics is probably 35-40 on party identity alone<br><br>and, just a hypothesis, much higher on GOP side given traditions of purity tests and single issue voters.<br><br>I just like making predictions on past data, not future speculation</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1721904497772089761","display_date":"November 07, 2023 · 14:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
