{"id":"twitter:1721203057617228158","tweet_id":"1721203057617228158","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1721203057617228158","title":"Starting with the \"Thaw\" in 1954 emigation was opened up and 53 exit passes were approved that first year In 156 the Politboro decided to empty a lot ","summary":"Starting with the \"Thaw\" in 1954 emigation was opened up and 53 exit passes were approved that first year In 156 the Politboro decided to empty a lot of the Gulags and let the zionists from the Prison Camp emigrate Moscow Choral Synagogue was allowed to open a small Yeshiva","date":"2023-11-05","published":"2023-11-05T16:29:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1721202038728528333","reply_tweet_id":"1721202038728528333","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Starting with the &quot;Thaw&quot; in 1954 emigation was opened up and 53 exit passes were approved that first year<br><br>In 156 the Politboro decided to empty a lot of the Gulags and let the zionists from the Prison Camp emigrate<br><br>Moscow Choral Synagogue  was allowed to open a small Yeshiva</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1721203057617228158","display_date":"November 05, 2023 · 16:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
