{"id":"twitter:1721199240720846920","tweet_id":"1721199240720846920","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1721199240720846920","title":"The Pravda article noted: \"An anti-patriotic group has developed in theatrical criticism. It consists of followers of bourgeois aestheticism These cri","summary":"The Pravda article noted: \"An anti-patriotic group has developed in theatrical criticism. It consists of followers of bourgeois aestheticism These critics have lost their sense of responsibility to the people. They represent a rootless cosmopolitanism.\" (Jewish Zionism)","date":"2023-11-05","published":"2023-11-05T16:14:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1721198509246877715","reply_tweet_id":"1721198509246877715","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The Pravda article noted:<br><br>&quot;An anti-patriotic group has developed in theatrical criticism. It  consists of followers of bourgeois aestheticism<br><br>These critics have lost their sense of responsibility to the people.  They represent a rootless cosmopolitanism.&quot;<br><br> (Jewish Zionism)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1721199240720846920","display_date":"November 05, 2023 · 16:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
