{"id":"twitter:1721196814550876615","tweet_id":"1721196814550876615","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1721196814550876615","title":"Russia was first Nation to recognize Israel. They strongly supported a two state solution, up to training PLO. USSR's love affair with Israel did not ","summary":"Russia was first Nation to recognize Israel. They strongly supported a two state solution, up to training PLO. USSR's love affair with Israel did not last long, at all. Ilya Ehrenburg published article in Pravda at behest of Politboru on 9-21-48, saying Israel wasn't for you https://t.co/S1iN3TYI07","date":"2023-11-05","published":"2023-11-05T16:04:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1721193762846556341","reply_tweet_id":"1721193762846556341","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Russia was first Nation to recognize Israel. They strongly supported a two state solution, up to training  PLO.<br><br>USSR&#x27;s love affair with Israel did not last long, at all.<br><br>Ilya Ehrenburg published article in Pravda at behest of  Politboru on 9-21-48, saying Israel wasn&#x27;t for you <a href=\"https://t.co/S1iN3TYI07\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/S1iN3TYI07</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/74123ae3aa471780fd4ce67e04cdb007.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1721196814550876615","display_date":"November 05, 2023 · 16:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/74123ae3aa471780fd4ce67e04cdb007.jpg"]}
