{"id":"twitter:1720913672556486865","tweet_id":"1720913672556486865","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1720913672556486865","title":"@PatriotKisses Also the organizers. There are legit cultural and human rights groups who co-organized. I don't know everyone on the list. Most people ","summary":"@PatriotKisses Also the organizers. There are legit cultural and human rights groups who co-organized. I don't know everyone on the list. Most people even those volunteering mean well. But other groups, you risk brand identity when you you work with other sus organizations. Due Diligence","date":"2023-11-04","published":"2023-11-04T21:19:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PatriotKisses/status/1720906451084796177","reply_tweet_id":"1720906451084796177","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PatriotKisses Also the organizers.<br><br>There are legit cultural and human rights groups who co-organized. I don&#x27;t know everyone on the list.<br><br>Most people even those volunteering mean well.<br><br>But other groups, you risk brand identity when you you work with other sus organizations.<br><br>Due Diligence</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1720913672556486865","display_date":"November 04, 2023 · 21:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1720912773469618454","tweet_id":"1720912773469618454","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1720912773469618454","title":"@RavenDemoncosis @WhatUpBash @BriannaWu What examples? Are you referring to DSA in the EU? Again it is a non-issue. Free speech doesn't exist on socia","summary":"@RavenDemoncosis @WhatUpBash @BriannaWu What examples? Are you referring to DSA in the EU? Again it is a non-issue. Free speech doesn't exist on social media because it isn't a construct between two private entities. And Social Media as private US entities have a free speech right to do business in EU or not.","date":"2023-11-04","published":"2023-11-04T21:15:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RavenDemoncosis/status/1720908184410296537","reply_tweet_id":"1720908184410296537","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RavenDemoncosis @WhatUpBash @BriannaWu What examples?<br><br>Are you referring to DSA in the EU?<br><br>Again it is a non-issue.<br><br>Free speech doesn&#x27;t exist on social media because it isn&#x27;t a construct between two private entities.<br><br>And Social Media as private US entities have a free speech right to do business in EU or not.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1720912773469618454","display_date":"November 04, 2023 · 21:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
