{"id":"twitter:1720439975592755488","tweet_id":"1720439975592755488","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1720439975592755488","title":"@mister_hooper I want a two state solution I want a cease fire in Gaza I want the hostages free I don't think we disagree I am asking people to questi","summary":"@mister_hooper I want a two state solution I want a cease fire in Gaza I want the hostages free I don't think we disagree I am asking people to question the Shepard and possible False Gazateers calling them to protest. I am equally critical of Israel's PR push Question the messengers","date":"2023-11-03","published":"2023-11-03T13:57:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/mister_hooper/status/1720439295498985775","reply_tweet_id":"1720439295498985775","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@mister_hooper I want a two state solution<br><br>I want a cease fire in Gaza<br><br>I want the hostages free<br><br>I don&#x27;t think we disagree<br><br>I am asking people to question the Shepard and possible False Gazateers calling them to protest.<br><br>I am equally critical of Israel&#x27;s PR push<br><br>Question the messengers</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1720439975592755488","display_date":"November 03, 2023 · 13:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
