{"id":"twitter:1720426766760653227","tweet_id":"1720426766760653227","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1720426766760653227","title":"@TomaszJeziers14 100% this. I also can't think of any parallel in history where self sovereignty lead to more terrorism. Recognizing a Free Palestine ","summary":"@TomaszJeziers14 100% this. I also can't think of any parallel in history where self sovereignty lead to more terrorism. Recognizing a Free Palestine will make Israel safer. Hamas knew this... That's why they want a long term war. Hamas doesn't want peace.","date":"2023-11-03","published":"2023-11-03T13:04:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TomaszJeziers14/status/1720425052871557180","reply_tweet_id":"1720425052871557180","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TomaszJeziers14 100% this.<br><br>I also can&#x27;t think of any parallel in history where self sovereignty lead to more terrorism.<br><br>Recognizing a Free Palestine will make Israel safer.<br><br>Hamas knew this... That&#x27;s why they want a long term war.<br><br>Hamas doesn&#x27;t want peace.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1720426766760653227","display_date":"November 03, 2023 · 13:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1720425460020969683","tweet_id":"1720425460020969683","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1720425460020969683","title":"Question to European friends. Do your countries have large Palestinian Diaspora communities? The protest you see in America are very real and they are","summary":"Question to European friends. Do your countries have large Palestinian Diaspora communities? The protest you see in America are very real and they aren't antisemitic. People hurting from decades of being a stateless Nation. People angered by seeing images of Gaza flattened.","date":"2023-11-03","published":"2023-11-03T12:59:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Question to European friends.<br><br>Do your countries have large Palestinian Diaspora communities?<br><br>The protest you see in America are very real and they aren&#x27;t antisemitic.<br><br>People hurting from decades of being a stateless Nation. People angered by seeing images of Gaza flattened.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1720425460020969683","display_date":"November 03, 2023 · 12:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
